
  How to run and test in Tarantool (Lua)

01. Compile module: `cargo build --release`

02. Copy the resulting `.so` lib file to the Tarantool module search directory.

03. Call from Lua:

  -- load a function from a binary module
  box.schema.func.create('my_tarantool_lib.add_some_action', {language = 'C'})

  -- function call
  local res = box.func['my_tarantool_lib.add_some_action']:call({101, 50})
